Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.31,0:00:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Kikkun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.40,0:00:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs21\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.5\pos(108.8,50.133)}Original Pi, datsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.31,0:00:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsun-tsun, another letter from the \NNobel Prize committee arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.43,0:00:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Just accept the award already!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.51,0:00:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I've decided that I won't accept those kinds of awards \Nuntil Papa gets the Best Father Award, tsun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.11,0:00:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsun-tsun...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.43,0:00:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Following Tsun-tsun's example, \NPapa started something new recently!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.66,0:00:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, tsun?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.86,0:00:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,An original Pi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.62,0:00:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,An original Pi? \NI thought you were up to something secret late into the night, tsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.07,0:00:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, so you found out? \NAnd here I meant for it to be a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.63,0:00:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It was finally completed yesterday.\NWould you like to hear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.20,0:00:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, tsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.41,0:00:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,3.7597952647899777777777777...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.97,0:00:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, the 7s just keep going from here, tsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.57,0:00:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep! 7 is a good number, \Nso I added plenty of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.05,0:00:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The more 7s there are, \Nthe better, tsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.89,0:00:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}LUCKY!{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.91,0:01:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...77774685303314567890!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.70,0:01:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Here come the two-digit numbers, tsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.67,0:01:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Right where it was getting monotonous, \NI threw in two-digit numbers as an accent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.47,0:01:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I overdo it a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.71,0:01:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all, tsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.03,0:01:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This might be a revolution in the mathematical world, tsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.90,0:01:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1}REVOLUTION!{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.20,0:01:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,1778236822989494786794947867...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.98,0:01:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Don't brood over your worries{\i0}," tsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.86,0:01:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,To think you embedded a message to youth inside Pi! 
